  "lines": [
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "How have things been since last time?"},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "Since last time the evening pain has crept up to about a six out of ten, give or take."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Is that worse after work?"},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "After work, yes, I'm certain of that, sitting at the till all day does it."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Any numbness in your legs?"},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "I haven't had any numbness, but there's maybe a bit of tingling in my left foot now and then."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Let me have a look at how you move."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Your back is pretty tight through the lower segments, and side bending to the left is reduced."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "I suspect the tingling is coming from a nerve getting a bit cranky, though I could be wrong, so let's watch it."},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "Oh, and going to the toilet has been normal, as far as I can tell."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Good. Keep the walks going, twenty minutes after tea rather than sitting straight down on the sofa."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "If the foot goes properly numb or weak, ring me before the next appointment."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "See you next week."}
  ],
